  "response_text": "It's important to note that I am not a doctor and cannot provide medical advice. However, I can offer some general information that may be helpful.\n\nIf you are experiencing irregular discharge and irritation, it is important to consult with a healthcare professional for an accurate diagnosis and appropriate treatment. Some warning signs that may indicate a medical issue include:\n\n- Discharge that is yellow, green, or has a foul odor\n- Discharge that is thick, white, or has a cottage cheese-like consistency\n- Discharge that is accompanied by itching, burning, or pain\n- Discharge that is accompanied by a rash or irritation\n- Discharge that is accompanied by a fever or chills\n\nIt is important to note that these warning signs may not always indicate a medical issue, and it is important to consult with a healthcare professional for an accurate diagnosis and appropriate treatment.",
